msgid ""
"%s User Manager is taking the place of several modules which have attempted "
"to create and manage users separate from Extensions. Modules such as "
"iSymphony and RestAPI are examples of these type of modules. For %s systems, "
"the new User Control Panel also uses User Manager."
msgstr ""
"%s User Manager 取代了若干試圖建立與管理獨立於分機以外使用者的模組。iSymphony 和 RestAPI 是這類模組的例子。對 %s 系統而言，新的 User Control Panel 也使用了 User Manager。"

